0 60 291 [
[(In each of the three pairs of oscillators above, the two)]
[(frequencies are within 1/3 Hz or closer \050for example, the)]
[(leftmost ones are close to 330 Hz but separated by 1/5 Hz\051.)]
[(The result is a gradual change in amplitude as the phases of)]
[(the two slip against each other. This is called beating.)]
[(More complex beating patterns may be made by using three or)]
[(more oscillators. Also their amplitudes need not be equal)]
[(\050as they are here\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
